# QRBuddy Environment Variables

# Supabase Configuration
# Get these from: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/YOUR_PROJECT/settings/api
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# Edge functions need the service role key inside Supabase secrets.
# Do not expose this key to the Fresh app or client bundle.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key-here

# Public URL used inside edge functions when generating share links
# Set to https://qrbuddy.app in production or http://localhost:8004 when testing locally
APP_URL=https://qrbuddy.app

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Edge Function secrets (set via `supabase secrets set` / dashboard, NOT
# read by the Fresh app — these only exist inside supabase/functions/).
# Every var below is read with `Deno.env.get(...) ?? ""`, so an unset var
# does not crash the function, it silently degrades. Listed here so that
# "unset" is a decision, not an accident.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- Square payments (_shared/square.ts, create-checkout, square-webhook) ---
# Missing SQUARE_ACCESS_TOKEN or SQUARE_LOCATION_ID: isSquareCheckoutConfigured()
# returns false and create-checkout responds 503 "Payments are not configured yet".
SQUARE_ACCESS_TOKEN=your-square-access-token
SQUARE_LOCATION_ID=your-square-location-id
# "production" hits the live connect.squareup.com. Anything else (including
# unset or "sandbox") safely defaults to connect.squareupsandbox.com.
SQUARE_ENVIRONMENT=sandbox
# Optional — defaults to 2026-01-22 if unset (_shared/square.ts:7).
SQUARE_API_VERSION=2026-01-22
# Missing this: getSquareConfig().webhookSignatureKey is empty string, and
# square-webhook/index.ts:18 refuses ALL webhook calls with 503 before even
# reading the signature — payments complete in Square but no license mints.
SQUARE_WEBHOOK_SIGNATURE_KEY=your-square-webhook-signature-key
# Square signs the URL it was registered with; the gateway-visible req.url
# can differ, so this overrides it for signature verification
# (square-webhook/index.ts:33). Leave unset only if req.url always matches
# exactly what's registered in the Square dashboard.
SQUARE_WEBHOOK_NOTIFICATION_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co/functions/v1/square-webhook

# --- Supporter Pass pricing (_shared/square.ts:32-36) ---
# Cents, defaults to 4900 ($49) if unset.
SUPPORTER_PRICE_CENTS=4900
# 🩸 CRITICAL: must exactly match the currency configured on the Square
# LOCATION above, or the Square API rejects the payment-link request outright
# (square.ts:34's own comment). Defaults to "AUD" if unset — but every
# route's JSON-LD ("priceCurrency") and routes/es/menus.tsx:45 ("$49 USD")
# advertise USD. Nobody has verified which currency the live Square location
# actually uses. DO NOT guess it here — pull the real value from the Square
# dashboard (Locations → currency) before deploying, and make it match the
# storefront copy or fix the storefront copy to match it.
SUPPORTER_CURRENCY=AUD

# --- Supporter Pass license tokens (_shared/license.ts) ---
# Self-verifying HMAC-SHA256 license token secret. Must be a real random
# secret of 16+ chars — getLicenseSecret() throws "LICENSE_SIGNING_KEY is not
# configured" below that length, which fails every issue/verify call.
# Losing/rotating this invalidates every already-issued supporter token.
LICENSE_SIGNING_KEY=generate-a-long-random-secret-here

# --- Cloudflare R2 (_shared/r2.ts — big-file presigned uploads for supporters) ---
# All four default to "" if unset, which makes presigned R2 URLs fail closed.
R2_ACCOUNT_ID=your-r2-account-id
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your-r2-access-key-id
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your-r2-secret-access-key
R2_BUCKET=your-r2-bucket-name

# --- Cron auth (cleanup-expired/index.ts:27-42) ---
# Bearer secret the hourly cleanup-expired cron must send as
# `Authorization: Bearer <value>`. Unset: the handler fails closed with a
# 401 (cleanup-expired/index.ts:28-32), so the cron never runs and expired
# files/buckets pile up forever instead of being purged.
CLEANUP_SECRET=generate-a-long-random-secret-here
